Third-party material
--------------------

This license covers the original work in this repository. It does not, and
cannot, cover material from other sources, which carries its own terms and
remains the property of its respective owners:

  - Software dependencies under their own licences, as declared in
    package.json and package-lock.json — including Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause)
    and Astro (MIT).

  - Glider observations, which this site reads directly from the IOOS
    Glider Data Assembly Center (https://gliders.ioos.us/erddap/) and does
    not redistribute. Each deployment remains the work of the operator
    named on it; the site credits that operator on every page it appears on.

  - Basemap tiles from Esri and its contributors (GEBCO, NOAA, National
    Geographic), used under Esri's terms and attributed on every map.

  - The TEOS-10 Absolute Salinity Anomaly atlas in public/teos10/, extracted
    from the Gibbs SeaWater Oceanographic Toolbox and carrying its terms.
